WEBVTT

00:00:00.035 --> 00:00:02.984
Score each rubric item and write down any place the reader

00:00:03.042 --> 00:00:03.483
guessed.

00:00:03.924 --> 00:00:06.780
Revise your package and ask the reader to explain the

00:00:06.838 --> 00:00:08.057
revised section again.

00:00:08.568 --> 00:00:12.307
A simulated agent review can find confusing language, but

00:00:12.353 --> 00:00:14.745
it is not the same as observing a real beginner.

00:00:15.441 --> 00:00:18.472
Keep the useful lessons for your next project: a better

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:21.873
prompt, a clearer template, or a failure pattern worth

00:00:21.931 --> 00:00:22.628
documenting.

00:00:23.139 --> 00:00:25.739
You have now practiced the entire method from cloud to

00:00:25.821 --> 00:00:29.130
contract and have a foundation for authorizing a safe

00:00:29.164 --> 00:00:29.559
build.
